y : α}, Iff (LE.le.{v} (f x) (f y)) (LE.le.{u} x y)) →\n    ∀ {s : Set.{u} α} {x : α}, IsGLB.{v} (Set.image.{u, v} f s) (f x) → IsGLB.{u} s x","unsafe":false,"value":230,"source":{"code":"theorem IsGLB.of_image [Preorder α] [Preorder β] {f : α → β} (hf : ∀ {x y}, f x ≤ f y ↔ x ≤ y)\n    {s : Set α} {x : α} (hx : IsGLB (f '' s) (f x)) : IsGLB s x :=\n  ⟨fun _ hy => hf.1 <| hx.1 <| mem_image_of_mem _ hy, fun _ hy =>\n    hf.1 <| hx.2 <| Monotone.mem_lowerBounds_image (fun _ _ => hf.2) hy⟩","start":551,"end":554},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}